<title>NETHERLANDS: DUTCH AEX SHARE INDEX CLOSES ABOVE 1000 PTS LEVEL.</title>
<headline>DUTCH AEX SHARE INDEX CLOSES ABOVE 1000 PTS LEVEL.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The main Dutch AEX share index closed above 1000 points for the first time in history on Thursday at 1010.97 points, a rise of 18.08 points or 1.82 percent. On July 3, the index closed above 900 points for the first time, at 900.68 points.</p>
<p>Dealers said shares were pushed higher today as rate hike worries faded.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
